                                                "sense_id": "843f2166-f184-3105-8810-92eadbd07aa6",
                                                "text": "Fumblingly she groped and groped, till the burning blood gushed from her nose and mouth; then, mercifully, her tired senses swooned, and she fell with her head resting on the tree."
